 1 sabre, 1 corrente e 1 capa de proteção.', 743.9, 561.32, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rd5m-lvyyg62s6nti23', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F939446263%2F23797989222', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
