e responde às perguntas frequentes dos potenciais compradores.', 138.39, 138.39, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > External Parts', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdws-lzqd06ve1cto2a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F337450537%2F22393261321', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
