e praticidade no dia a dia.', 999.99, 440.99, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Monitors', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81z1k-mht63qqi2c5dc5', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1333507062%2F22898765117', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
